### 🛠️ Frequently Asked Questions
* **Is `#LancsBox 6.0` the same as `#LancsBox X`?** No; `#LancsBox X` is the newer release used throughout this course with updated CQL, Smart Searches, Corpus Hub, and Summary Tables[cite: 8, 16, 17].
* **Why did searching `carry` give different results in the activity?** Typing `carry` only searches the exact word form *carry*[cite: 8, 16]. To include inflected forms (*carries, carried, carrying*), use lemma/headword search or Smart Search[cite: 8, 13, 16].
* **What does sorting by the `Node` column do?** It sorts concordance lines alphabetically by the word form in the node position (helpful when your query matches multiple word forms via wildcards, lemmas, or Smart Searches); if every node is identical, clicking Node resets/randomizes the order[cite: 8, 16, 17].
* **Where do I report OS/Java crashes or script rendering issues?** For issues like Alpine Linux OpenJDK `libprism_es2.so` crashes, macOS installation blocks, or blank Arabic script lines in KWIC, use the helpdesk form at **[lancsbox.lancs.ac.uk](https://lancsbox.lancs.ac.uk)**[cite: 8, 16].
